64.docs:
Indicates whether this unparker will unpark the associated parker.

This can be used to avoid unnecessary work before calling `unpark()`.

# Examples

```
use parking::Parker;

let p = Parker::new();
let u = p.unparker();

assert!(u.will_unpark(&p));
```

